{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "ace28f89228dbe96b475ce2d6fe0cefe98f1a40a8040038816dbe164ac868f38", "ja": "リリィ・クエスト ～天空の子豚～ 旅立ち", "zh": "莉莉任务 ～天空小猪～ 启程", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ee432e9da7219d9da2c0297ea4515e9ece322dc41df22c18c19644a233296a32", "ja": "ミリオネージュ大陸で暮らす普通の女の子、\r\n百合子は、15歳の誕生日、妖精の星梨花と\r\n出会い勇者リリィ・ナイトとなる。魔王から\r\n世界を救うため、旅立つ百合子達。そして、\r\nその動きを察した魔王も動き始めた……。", "zh": "生活在米利奥内日大陆的普通女孩百合子，在15岁生日这天，  \n遇见了妖精星梨花，成为勇者莉莉·奈特。为了从魔王手中  \n拯救世界，百合子一行踏上了旅途。而察觉到她们行动的  \n魔王，也开始行动起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1000_026yur", "source_sha256": "51447bb59377c3fb9c9e82343ece3e5143043deed92c978ee86e92e209fbbae5", "ja": "目を閉じれば、広がる空。冒険の大地。\n陽気な港町に吹く潮風。堅牢な城壁に守られた王都。", "zh": "一闭上眼，天空便在眼前铺展开来。冒险的大地。吹拂着欢快港口城镇的海风。由坚固城墙守护的王都。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "35c44d1d7b25f0817acb8f28d22979d4f4b1010206e352942d5d21573b45e478", "ja": "崖の下に眠る財宝。深海の都。出会いも、涙も、\n笑顔も、約束も……全部、私の手の中にある。", "zh": "沉睡在悬崖之下的财宝。深海之都。相遇与泪水，\n笑容与约定……全都在我的手中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "9b33f779dd69fb5e2c63f0696a4efe0da23eae51773a07a3e159f6d5f1e859c7", "ja": "この一冊の本の中に……。", "zh": "全都在这一本书里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1003_se", "source_sha256": "172a52394be90cca6467e0a57d29eba5541a0b314af596f3855f7d00b40d23ab", "ja": "パタン", "zh": "磅", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "26ac6218d6f6a6dc444dfe493337d57a3887aeb6e377599d66d376d8f0860cef", "ja": "……はぁ。やっぱり『アデライトと七つの世界』は\n最高だなぁ。でも、いつもいいところで終わっちゃう。", "zh": "……哈。果然，《阿德莱特与七个世界》最棒了。不过，总是每次都在最精彩的地方结束。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "a033882b8a10a906c6e389d3d2a20ffeda1e7ac894d450466de6f70a9bde66e0", "ja": "この本、よく見ると『上巻』って書いてあるし、\n続きがあるってことだよね……。続きが読みたいなぁ。", "zh": "仔细一看，这本书上写着“上卷”，也就是说还有后续吧……真想看看后面的内容啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "f621a6e3b32d54c1449e0e539d454ea084e6203d4395587af04c2ebd56b8cd14", "ja": "この村を出ることができたら、たくさん本を買うんだ。\nきっとそこにはこの本の続きも……ふふっ♪", "zh": "要是能离开这个村子，我一定要买好多书。那里肯定也会有这本书的续集……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "1cb617503e0a7b39f344801e6f6efbd11fb5e396f7eb294c9585859dfb467341", "ja": "あっ！　もう寝ないと。おばあちゃんに怒られちゃう。\nそれじゃあ、おやすみなさい。", "zh": "啊！得睡觉了。要不然奶奶会生气的。\n那么，晚安。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1008_null", "source_sha256": "72957f633f0d11e4e4a1da03762bd9e36391961c28661e5da3787ac19bdedd6c", "ja": "―　さいはての森　―", "zh": "―　最边境之森　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "f11625d8e9c07c99e3637ba93ed9e23e3acca9013bd7cff9a8089bdb4df3fbac", "ja": "……ふぅ。\n勇者さん、突然わたしを見たらびっくりしちゃうかな？", "zh": "……呼。\n勇者先生，突然看到我的话，会不会吓一跳呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "344fd9d46d4ccac3fc2ca2c0f949febc91bbf184ab96189911a5873d6da3b453", "ja": "でも、大切な御役目をまかされたんだもの！\n妖精族の代表として、がんばって説得しなくちゃ！", "zh": "但是，我可是被托付了重要使命的！\n作为妖精族的代表，一定要努力说服他才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "e1fa8c74d4feba693926552bdb1a103033b268522c5e78bbf8ca5440040640f3", "ja": "勇者さんのおうちに到着です！　でも、おうちの中に\n入れません。どうしよう～……あっ！", "zh": "到勇者先生家啦！可是进不去屋里。怎么办呀～……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "f4a50c750676169212bd87d34c0220eeb6bf356e64f315616f4abe4c779d6230", "ja": "えへへっ。窓が空いていてよかったです。\n勇者さん、勇者さんっ。起きて、起きてくださいっ。", "zh": "嘿嘿。窗户开着真是太好了。勇者先生，勇者先生！快醒醒，请醒醒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "1118256d5c10fd85b2042984700c028171b8d5ce0108e8af17db5f8640ea1a59", "ja": "今日は百合子さんの15歳の誕生日です！\n旅立ちの日が来たんですよ！", "zh": "今天是百合子小姐15岁的生日！\n启程之日到了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "c019a029fe4402df5057ddb960c6ceb680fc825bd0c76e5f4d4039ea4d64771b", "ja": "んん……たびだち……。……え？　……ええっ？\n……ちいさい……女の子。……妖精？　本物！？", "zh": "嗯嗯……启程……。……咦？……诶诶？\n……小小的……女孩子。……妖精？真的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "26ddaffbe65de30de281875e1c051547d0e2b49e118548e4352450007f8d9118", "ja": "あっ！　……あなたは……まさか……？\n風の妖精エルフェリオンね！？", "zh": "啊！……你……难道是……？\n风之妖精艾尔菲莉昂对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "c8fac6fadb7a4c462c513067cb63e192066e81cf65f2c548db46e31e0fd73741", "ja": "いえ、わたしは普通の妖精で、星梨花っていいます。\n勇者さん、よろしくお願いしますね。えへへっ♪", "zh": "不是的，我只是一只普通的妖精，名字叫星梨花。\n勇者大人，请多关照啦。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "aa77e4db67682f10444c434bfc36806c0d5d9a3ebb59c244609ef9f6a07026b0", "ja": "かわいい……じゃなかった。旅立ちってどういうこと？\n私、ごく普通の村娘のはずだけど……。", "zh": "好可爱……不对，出发旅行是什么意思？我明明应该只是个普通的村姑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "99eabff12938fdb5d11400a3f2872c90b76b9edb311a323878ce4b9881488768", "ja": "はい！\n百合子さんはあの伝説の勇者の末裔なんです！", "zh": "是的！\n百合子姐姐就是那位传说中的勇者后裔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "2373afbe05b3a666bcf681f20ad3eccc002f7cdee1acf4edc2d719d923f0b0c2", "ja": "ミリオネージュ大陸の半分は魔王に支配されています。\nでも、妖精の国には予言が伝わっていたんです。", "zh": "米利奥内茹大陆的一半都被魔王统治着。\n但是，妖精之国流传着一个预言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1020_022ser", "source_sha256": "78fd0a9eaf1f3130d0ff9e12f58dc6d44f4ad8261917e21d7ac0d6d0c65630cd", "ja": "『大地が闇に覆われし時、さいはての森に、勇気の光が\nともるであろう』と！　それが、百合子さんなんです！", "zh": "“当大地被黑暗笼罩之时，勇气之光将会在尽头之森中\n点亮”！那个人就是百合子小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1021_026yur", "source_sha256": "1d734cce790c18c14dc5148b7c73842971dd0b7e7a6ca0adaf1fe672c19bf75d", "ja": "わ、私……？　確かにご先祖さまの伝記には、\nたくさん冒険のお話が書いてあったけど……。", "zh": "我、我吗……？祖先大人的传记里确实\n写了好多冒险故事，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "6b99438019e250abea905ced31a9c49b90bbec103f40022bbcd8e4d7be9c0bbe", "ja": "私にあんなすごいことができるとは思えない。\n私、運動神経はあまりよくないの。", "zh": "我不觉得自己能做到那么厉害的事。我不太擅长运动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "7f1168307edc4589c046d0c8c0a1dd71b9a44b36a03411a61215ee760415bbba", "ja": "百合子さん……。\nでも、わたしたちには百合子さんしかいないんです。", "zh": "百合子姐姐……  \n可是，对我们来说，只有百合子姐姐了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1024_022ser", "source_sha256": "956925ee00b18a5828265f9e841460d81413163cca0b115d1519b4d04bfbd782", "ja": "この世界の人々を救うために力を貸してくれませんか？\n世界の未来は、百合子さんにかかっているんです！", "zh": "为了拯救这个世界的人们，您愿意助我们一臂之力吗？\n世界的未来，就托付给百合子小姐了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "9eae8b976f57bb0e4c7498a84247a598f5a5b427131b38b9a7dd28b8463d535e", "ja": "世界を……救う？　未来が……私にかかって……\n……ああ……！", "zh": "拯救世界……？未来……寄托在我身上……\n……啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1026_026yur", "source_sha256": "00a5d60d55b42763cc7881392d16b0dd8c244bd7e36cc1349fbabbe7c189aa9f", "ja": "魔王の圧政から民衆を解放するには、\nそれしか手立てがないんですよね！？", "zh": "要从魔王的暴政下解放民众，就只有这一条路了，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "ed3a4102b6a67377ddeac6ad5557fd64488436b55475e3650dcadab90ca8688d", "ja": "は、はい。そうです！", "zh": "是、是的。就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "b33ac297d52d253c01e5a3119d3fafa8093690b7dfbb48f6bdf5f4544ec2bb7b", "ja": "わかりました。私、勇者を引き受けます。\n今日から私は勇者リリィ・ナイト。", "zh": "明白了。我来担任勇者。\n从今天起，我就是勇者莉莉·奈特。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "04e12144cae2289b5225cf8fb5313586f1cc341e09103df8ac0e9edb640172c9", "ja": "この先にどんな困難が待ち受けていようとも、私は\n決してくじけない。正義を信じ、突き進んでみせます！", "zh": "无论前方等待着怎样的困难，我都绝不会气馁。我会相信正义，勇往直前！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1030_026yur", "source_sha256": "41504a1545b78b20837ab7ebdc7cf907c31000eff7ba83ba59127965c2ccc63f", "ja": "これからよろしくね、エルフェリオン……\nじゃなくて、星梨花ちゃん！", "zh": "今后也请多多关照，艾尔菲利翁……\n不对，是星梨花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1031_null", "source_sha256": "11f2eb6b43c1f72ba95bfcaa42cda2d59d1172f39ed1bc07427479a4ae316441", "ja": "―　魔王城　―", "zh": "―　魔王城　―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1032_028ari", "source_sha256": "e24f3c7fea0ed9ffbba9a127238e5d7a1aa8abf8e04858e42d496d1f85d8c191", "ja": "魔王さま、魔王朋花さま～！\n……わわっ！　うう……いたた……。", "zh": "魔王大人，魔王朋花大人～！……哇哇！呜呜……好痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "084a1bf94f424f21cb6058e04becd9013a7c897ee86c656216bfd680fa761aee", "ja": "無様ですね～♪　あまり無様な真似ばかりをしていると\n四天王からコメツキバッタ役に降格ですからね～？", "zh": "真狼狈呢～♪要是总是做出这么狼狈的举动，可是会从四天王降格成磕头蚱蜢的哦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "3907c2a236abaf3c8d3366a5b5ba4008ec3b995ffe9d9407cddc256663a35d64", "ja": "そ、それだけはカンベンしてください～！\nありさ、きっと魔王さまのお役に立ちますから～！", "zh": "这、这个就请饶了我吧～！\n亚利沙一定会为魔王大人效劳的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "84cab221af643ec56881abad5deb000498ea94017d0d42d5dba37d34182ef628", "ja": "うふっ。……まあ、いいでしょう。\nそれで、なに用ですか～？", "zh": "呵呵。……好吧，这次就饶了你。\n那么，找我有什么事呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1036_028ari", "source_sha256": "e80972b9ed79604f564d7c5a24c686ce52c958280231159a3c33a67b107d4da3", "ja": "そうでしたっ！　ありさアンテナに反応アリです！\nさいはての森の勇者ちゃんが動き出したみたいですっ！", "zh": "对了！亚利沙天线有反应啦！  \n世界尽头森林的勇者似乎开始行动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1037_031tom", "source_sha256": "b9d3c065ab405f37bc8a7791c914a3197675594cf04fde649db874322033b589", "ja": "うふふ、困ったものです。私の野望を阻もうとは、\nなんと愚かなことを考えるのでしょう～。", "zh": "呵呵，真让人头疼呢。竟然妄想阻挠我的野心，\n究竟是多么愚蠢的想法呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1038_028ari", "source_sha256": "c13f4a31f39138223eb5a5d966dd8944c169cd29ef4f7f4c1deec4c34c98664a", "ja": "魔王さまのお手をわずらわせることもありません！\n勇者ちゃんの件はこの四天王ありさにお任せください！", "zh": "不必劳烦魔王大人出手！勇者小姑娘的事，就交给四天王亚利沙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "1a81824b855042bd740055ee32cde247b2bca1442d9cfbe9ea3b0e8903568342", "ja": "ふふふ、いいでしょう。この件は亜利沙さんに\n一任します～。けれど……わかっていますか～？", "zh": "呵呵呵，可以哦。这件事就全权交给亚利沙了～不过……你明白了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0179_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0179_story_01_1040_028ari", "source_sha256": "75030bb0829c249dc70ead8f4131ec07e4bbc6d89eb6b047e234a9aefddce641", "ja": "ひ、ひぃ！　わかってますとも。ここにたどり着く前に\n始末してご覧に入れましょう！　……ムフフ♪", "zh": "呜、呜哇！我当然知道啦。在您到达这里之前，我就先处理好给您看！……嘿嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
